  "section_type": "Class Roster",
  "class_designation": "[{\"text\":\"The School Chapel\",\"height\":0.033550488599348505,\"x\":0.316561851485664,\"width\":0.33962263392594666,\"y\":0.8749185669662748},{\"text\":\"People never realise how much certain\",\"height\":0.011726384364820874,\"x\":0.1299790507646072,\"width\":0.33333331419405576,\"y\":0.8182410425960057},{\"text\":\"things mean to them until these are lost.\",\"height\":0.01802429236495917,\"x\":0.08579767691711238,\"width\":0.3754979848637406,\"y\":0.8005074128915495},{\"text\":\"Seven years have slipped by silently and\",\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"x\":0.08805031000108263,\"width\":0.37316561507819845,\"y\":0.7848837211435835},{\"text\":\"just when I am about to leave Wah Yan, I\",\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"x\":0.08595388095697895,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"y\":0.7688953489173238},{\"text\":\"suddenly appreciate how very attached I am\",\"height\":0.01467313052000363,\"x\":0.0859538734751874,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.7527687299013353},{\"text\":\"to it. I shall miss the lawn I have treaded\",\"height\":0.01766120960347428,\"x\":0.085777654620096,\"width\":0.37562461989394696,\"y\":0.7365329949504285},{\"text\":\"on many-a-time when Unnoticed, the gold-\",\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.08595388095697895,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"y\":0.7208469056968247},{\"text\":\"fish in the pond which I liked to feel strug-\",\"height\":0.01796794481308539,\"x\":0.08575251791512037,\"width\":0.3777381129009143,\"y\":0.7034236542801982},{\"text\":\"gling and bouncing in my hands, and even\",\"height\":0.01601677934975887,\"x\":0.08595387771173517,\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"y\":0.6889250811651025},{\"text\":\"the endless slope I used to curse.\",\"height\":0.013082342116762846,\"x\":0.08595388338968102,\"width\":0.28092243126396405,\"y\":0.6729641691886046},{\"text\":\"But most\",\"height\":0.010423453079372758,\"x\":0.38364779958862955,\"width\":0.07966456588214005,\"y\":0.6742671006877965},{\"text\":\"ot all, I miss the school chapel.\",\"height\":0.014659874136362383,\"x\":0.08385745117316672,\"width\":0.27463311153207315,\"y\":0.6540697674420333},{\"text\":\"It is dusky within the chapel. On en-\",\"height\":0.017589576547231367,\"x\":0.1257861655971637,\"width\":0.3375261940153163,\"y\":0.6234527689187679},{\"text\":\"tering, the first thing that meets my eyes is\",\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"x\":0.08595387441334253,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.6090116278199401},{\"text\":\"the Colossal cross, on which the dying Jesus\",\"height\":0.01609726511306009,\"x\":0.08595389422827852,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"y\":0.5930232562971541},{\"text\":\"welcomes everyone with extended arms.\",\"height\":0.013081394655308332,\"x\":0.08805032047903057,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.578488372415563},{\"text\":\"Below the cross is the barely-adorned altar，\",\"height\":0.014669343159330772,\"x\":0.08805032047903057,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.5609120521699539},{\"text\":\"which is significant for its simplicity. But\",\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.08595388430514818,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"y\":0.5449511403056673},{\"text\":\"the most impressive things are the pathetic\",\"height\":0.016802826921792247,\"x\":0.08582837696577061,\"width\":0.37551452119958256,\"y\":0.5287286032305717},{\"text\":\"Stations of the Cross on the lateral walls.\",\"height\":0.011726384364820874,\"x\":0.08595388285673851,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.5159609119654261},{\"text\":\"They manifest vividly the sufferings Our\",\"height\":0.014657980456026176,\"x\":0.08385743546431669,\"width\":0.3773584948994591,\"y\":0.49706840410363384},{\"text\":\"Lord underwent. His lean and weary face\",\"height\":0.013355048859934882,\"x\":0.08805031926034168,\"width\":0.3731656150781985,\"y\":0.4824104235566763},{\"text\":\"depicts His agony, not so much His phy-\",\"height\":0.014688281205267328,\"x\":0.0859538775632376,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.4651162788591845},{\"text\":\"sical suffering, but the mental wounds in\",\"height\":0.018630189926694185,\"x\":0.08571428266543465,\"width\":0.37567422890147284,\"y\":0.44922436382671127},{\"text\":\"the depth of His Sacred Heart. Beside Him\",\"height\":0.013146730975918341,\"x\":0.08595388285673851,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.4345276873364743},{\"text\":\"are the merciless soldiers who whip and\",\"height\":0.013119270747181666,\"x\":0.08595388165128783,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.4185667752541644},{\"text\":\"mock the vulnerable and submissive victim.\",\"height\":0.01335504885993477,\"x\":0.08595389688376413,\"width\":0.37735846619054264,\"y\":0.40390879494677556},{\"text\":\"I can almost see His lips tremble, His\",\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"x\":0.08385743546431669,\"width\":0.3773584948994591,\"y\":0.3735465115626727},{\"text\":\"fragile body dragging the ponderous cross\",\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"x\":0.08385743635530199,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"y\":0.3575581396876728},{\"text\":\"with the heavier end on the ground, which\",\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.08385744395488255,\"width\":0.3773584948994591,\"y\":0.3400651466234955},{\"text\":\"makes it even more burdensome for the\",\"height\":0.013180819707118818,\"x\":0.08595388086512432,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.3255813955320841},{\"text\":\"over-exhausted Jesus. And there is Mary，\",\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"x\":0.08595388191858344,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.30813953524502014},{\"text\":\"His loving mother, apparently broken-heart-\",\"height\":0.016286644951140072,\"x\":0.08595388285673851,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.29055374566497727},{\"text\":\"ed and helpless.\",\"height\":0.013173244364486858,\"x\":0.08385744390204042,\"width\":0.1446540810987844,\"y\":0.2775244299253766},{\"text\":\"It is obvious that her\",\"height\":0.013173243743200724,\"x\":0.236897272955864,\"width\":0.2243186541581535,\"y\":0.2775244302559652},{\"text\":\"mental pain is unparelleled.\",\"height\":0.013115483386508808,\"x\":0.08385744826951708,\"width\":0.23899370482364918,\"y\":0.26017441896958415},{\"text\":\"Every time, when l enter the chapel\",\"height\":0.013090864299562965,\"x\":0.1278826133170182,\"width\":0.33333331419405576,\"y\":0.2296416935840505},{\"text\":\"alone, the ‘Tabernacle lamp’fascinates me.\",\"height\":0.014675971661794462,\"x\":0.08385744679803833,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.21366279063243998},{\"text\":\"It shines meekly through the duskiness, and\",\"height\":0.01466460833720351,\"x\":0.08385744082319567,\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"y\":0.1960912054634959},{\"text\":\"gquides me to the altar like the beam from\",\"height\":0.013183659606337161,\"x\":0.0838574376785417,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.18013029337175301},{\"text\":\"a lighthouse. On approaching it, I always\",\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.08385744585988321,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.16416938135346215},{\"text\":\"visualize that Our Lord is at the same time\",\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"x\":0.08385744265757718,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.14970930247837044},{\"text\":\"treading softly to meet me, ready to allevi-\",\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.08385744585988321,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.1322475570036028},{\"text\":\"ate my troubles and sorrow. It is during\",\"height\":0.014665555798658025,\"x\":0.08385744829174889,\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"y\":0.11627906949629663},{\"text\":\"this private rendezvous that I pour forth my\",\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"x\":0.5073375306554806,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.8168604651237192},{\"text\":\"wishes, offer the pains inflicted by others，\",\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"x\":0.5073375446825062,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"y\":0.8008720929459092},{\"text\":\"and beg Him for the grace St. Francis of\",\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"x\":0.5073375245104382,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"y\":0.7848837207196495},{\"text\":\"Assisi prayed for，\",\"height\":0.014667449478994343,\"x\":0.5094339658729242,\"width\":0.15513626629747768,\"y\":0.7703488371319557},{\"text\":\"‘Grant that I may not so much seek to\",\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.5262054476022134,\"width\":0.35639412450207253,\"y\":0.7426710100142351},{\"text\":\"be consoled as to console，\",\"height\":0.01619744813403412,\"x\":0.5719858285148293,\"width\":0.22504339639801862,\"y\":0.7251708729133426},{\"text\":\"To be understood\",\"height\":0.013358577765548718,\"x\":0.5301801663371891,\"width\":0.15347386213932412,\"y\":0.7003893793357521},{\"text\":\"as to understand，\",\"height\":0.013081394655308332,\"x\":0.6876310307925609,\"width\":0.15513626629747757,\"y\":0.6976744187333923},{\"text\":\"To be loved as to love.\",\"height\":0.013159040519391318,\"x\":0.5303983275338945,\"width\":0.20964360349265787,\"y\":0.6830618893421776},{\"text\":\"For it is in giving that we receive，\",\"height\":0.01606128332280965,\"x\":0.5241090102015484,\"width\":0.2976939218400899,\"y\":0.6656976745444894},{\"text\":\"It is in pardoning that we are pardoned，\",\"height\":0.01744185954041133,\"x\":0.5283018898769204,\"width\":0.3438155137472071,\"y\":0.6497093024972362},{\"text\":\"And it is in dying that we are born to\",\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.5513626847197619,\"width\":0.33123690299234176,\"y\":0.6234527688671185},{\"text\":\"eternal life.'\",\"height\":0.015649248800370885,\"x\":0.5700781202957715,\"width\":0.10722321647579447,\"y\":0.6084544455601366},{\"text\":\"and I always emerge from the chapel with\",\"height\":0.01467218367983536,\"x\":0.5052410960451901,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"y\":0.5798045604866586},{\"text\":\"a lighter heart.\",\"height\":0.01600162866449506,\"x\":0.49895178767640025,\"width\":0.1362683358107214,\"y\":0.5625000001985592},{\"text\":\"I am glad that our chapel is small. It\",\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"x\":0.5492662597268715,\"width\":0.33333331419405576,\"y\":0.536337209346103},{\"text\":\"provides an atmosphere of intimacy. Dur-\",\"height\":0.014688281205267328,\"x\":0.5031446580255842,\"width\":0.37945490610117305,\"y\":0.520195439656963},{\"text\":\"ing Mass, by being near to the priest at the\",\"height\":0.014660820976530653,\"x\":0.5031446580255842,\"width\":0.37945490610117305,\"y\":0.5042345278895757},{\"text\":\"altar, I feel that I am not watching the\",\"height\":0.016864513807265613,\"x\":0.500946868602264,\"width\":0.3817703663349601,\"y\":0.48789193316194823},{\"text\":\"celebration only, I am making the same\",\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"x\":0.5031446666209718,\"width\":0.37945490610117294,\"y\":0.47383720951567665},{\"text\":\"offering to God together with the celebrant\",\"height\":0.013100332701244999,\"x\":0.5052410871673998,\"width\":0.37316561507819845,\"y\":0.4592833877913801},{\"text\":\"I am no longer an individual but rather, a\",\"height\":0.018842219995753307,\"x\":0.5008281082739587,\"width\":0.3799163445143462,\"y\":0.44013269263077104},{\"text\":\"part of a closely-united congregation.\",\"height\":0.014693962246276726,\"x\":0.5010482305024787,\"width\":0.3459119249489211,\"y\":0.4273255816086998},{\"text\":\"The\",\"height\":0.011762366155071424,\"x\":0.844863730766817,\"width\":0.03563941388565306,\"y\":0.42732558142381405},{\"text\":\"usual lack of communication has vanished.\",\"height\":0.013092757979899394,\"x\":0.505241108623806,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"y\":0.4113372096248652},{\"text\":\"When the priest says 'let us offer each other\",\"height\":0.011726384364820874,\"x\":0.5073375306554806,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"y\":0.3967426710605577},{\"text\":\"the sign of peace'， I nod to my neighbours\",\"height\":0.016079273907291802,\"x\":0.505241097442814,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"y\":0.37936046559947967},{\"text\":\"whole-heartedly, and am completely free\",\"height\":0.013175138044823287,\"x\":0.501048221966884,\"width\":0.37945490610117305,\"y\":0.36337209334579545},{\"text\":\"from the embarrassment often experienced\",\"height\":0.017902225158890173,\"x\":0.5008617775128235,\"width\":0.3798638933240974,\"y\":0.34652570610234557},{\"text\":\"in other churches.\",\"height\":0.015421784739540922,\"x\":0.5006437780020138,\"width\":0.1623499557193674,\"y\":0.3321931051155578},{\"text\":\"The chapel is the most\",\"height\":0.013102226381581428,\"x\":0.5492662520007794,\"width\":0.20545072367139727,\"y\":0.30521172662921237},{\"text\":\"alluring place\",\"height\":0.013159040519391207,\"x\":0.758909857595102,\"width\":0.12159328514522583,\"y\":0.3037790701868808},{\"text\":\"in the school.\",\"height\":0.016938915936100418,\"x\":0.498834989249216,\"width\":0.13230906044214485,\"y\":0.28586193735072674},{\"text\":\"Yet there is always the\",\"height\":0.019554192856779284,\"x\":0.6286724013562698,\"width\":0.2522529035049683,\"y\":0.28665443044037453},{\"text\":\"same and small congregation and we al-\",\"height\":0.014675971661794462,\"x\":0.5010482235479461,\"width\":0.37945490610117294,\"y\":0.27166123759675387},{\"text\":\"ways have the same few Epistle readers.\",\"height\":0.013090864299562965,\"x\":0.501048221966884,\"width\":0.37945490610117305,\"y\":0.2572674421345551},{\"text\":\"The organ is cbsolete and seldom played, as\",\"height\":0.016074539706450675,\"x\":0.5010482259588476,\"width\":0.37945490610117294,\"y\":0.23973941376504837},{\"text\":\"if it is a symbol of the students’\",\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.5010482325314697,\"width\":0.30188677295243416,\"y\":0.22671009752866222},{\"text\":\"religious\",\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.8029350100241631,\"width\":0.07756813314873878,\"y\":0.2237785013826079},{\"text\":\"Lethargy. There are nearly four hundred\",\"height\":0.013173244364486858,\"x\":0.5010482127179854,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"y\":0.20930232589182263},{\"text\":\"Catholics among us, yet why is it so very\",\"height\":0.014689228045435598,\"x\":0.5010482239277897,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"y\":0.19315960919276376},{\"text\":\"diticult to fill the chapel with pews for two\",\"height\":0.013355048859934882,\"x\":0.5010482330822267,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"y\":0.17719869686482903},{\"text\":\"hundred\",\"height\":0.012013915618001914,\"x\":0.500990272584534,\"width\":0.0797804637776156,\"y\":0.16405118181634148},{\"text\":\"and fifty？\",\"height\":0.01539615916895165,\"x\":0.5763754857184051,\"width\":0.08833917310971307,\"y\":0.16090657151643184},{\"text\":\"Louis Au Yeung\",\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"x\":0.6897274633946637,\"width\":0.14675052100941466,\"y\":0.13517441890781112},{\"text\":\"（Upper 6 Arts）\",\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"x\":0.748427676371406,\"width\":0.12997903043328873,\"y\":0.11482558143912613},{\"text\":\"145\",\"height\":0.013141996775077325,\"x\":0.8448637315835601,\"width\":0.03354297756363733,\"y\":0.06970684016013506}]",
